.SH Name
a2i
\-
convert a string to an integer
.
.
.SH Library
String-to-integer library
.RI ( liba2i ,\~ \-la2i )
.
.
.SH Synopsis
.nf
.B #include <a2i/a2i.h>
.fi
.P
.B int
.SY a2i(
.BI typename\~ T ,
.BI T\~*restrict\~ n ,
.BI QChar\~* s ,
.br
.BI QChar\~**_Nullable\~restrict\~ endp ,
.BI int\~ base ,
.br
.BI T\~ min ,
.BI T\~ max );
.YS
.
.
.SH Description
This macro is like
.BR a2s (3)
and
.BR a2u (3),
but works with all integer types.
.
.
